OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man Assisted Dying Bill
OL,4,Agiven Royal Assent
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's Assisted Dying Bill
OL,7,Fhas been granted Royal Assent.
OL,9,FThe law will allow adults who have
OL,10,Flived on the island for at least five
OL,11,Fyears, who have a terminal illness with
OL,12,Fa life expectancy of 12 months or less,
OL,13,Fto request an assisted death.
OL,15,FIn a statement, the Dignity in Dying
OL,16,Fcampaign group said: "The milestone is
OL,17,Fa tribute to the Manx families who
OL,18,Fcampaigned for years for a change in
OL,19,Fthe law."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
